{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/bf173dddbef6cad7934d6f986d228d3c.poster.avif?t=1758340913\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/bf173dddbef6cad7934d6f986d228d3c.webm?t=1758340913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/bf173dddbef6cad7934d6f986d228d3c.mp4?t=1758340913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>No mistakes. No mercy. No Hit Allowed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself in this minimalist one-button incremental defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One hit, and it\u2019s over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, parry, upgrade, and grow \u2014 reach the very end without taking a single hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 70+ upgrades and evolve from a Parry Newbie into a true Parry Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/d673bb1f18f99774e64fff8fffb67d1d.poster.avif?t=1758340913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/d673bb1f18f99774e64fff8fffb67d1d.webm?t=1758340913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042170/extras/d673bb1f18f99774e64fff8fffb67d1d.mp4?t=1758340913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag